#: ../../../reference/interfaces/desktop-launch-interface.md:2
msgid "desktop-launch interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/desktop-launch-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `desktop-launch` interface allows {ref}`strictly confined <explanation-"
"security-snap-confinement>` snaps to identify and launch desktop "
"applications in (or from) other snaps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/desktop-launch-interface.md:7
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/desktop-launch-interface.md:9
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/desktop-launch-interface.md:9
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/desktop-launch-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"<h3 id='heading--endpoint-access'>Endpoint access permissions</h3>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>/v2/snaps/{name}</li>\n"
"<li>/v2/snaps</li>\n"
"<li>/v2/icons/{name}/icon</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/desktop-launch-interface.md:20
